{"id":"86be4df10dc371c0","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-abelian-quotient.md","title":"thm-abelian-quotient","display":"thm-abelian-quotient","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-abelian]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence-modular]]"],"display":"thm-abelian-quotient","label":"93-thm-abelian-quotient","aliases":["93-thm-abelian-quotient"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" href=\"?note=c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" title=\"93-df-congruence-modular\">93-df-congruence-modular</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abelian-quotient"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-abelian-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-abelian-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-abelian-quotient-thm-abelian-quotient\">thm-abelian-quotient <code>thm-abelian-quotient</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbAlg}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\)</span> is the class from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([-,-]_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is the commutator from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed quotient constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\n\\leftrightarrow[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq\\theta\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\n\\leftrightarrow[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq\\theta\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, the commutator of the universal congruence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A/\\theta\">\\(\\mathbf A/\\theta\\)</span> with itself is its diagonal. The condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,\\theta]=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([\\theta,\\theta]=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> concerns <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> and does not characterize abelianness of the quotient.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-abelian-quotient-thm-abelian-quotient","text":"thm-abelian-quotient `thm-abelian-quotient`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-abelian]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-modular","status":"resolved","id":"c8ff2f79b6a4018b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-modular]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the class from [[93-df-abelian]], and $[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}$ is the commutator from [[93-df-commutator]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the class from [[93-df-abelian]], and $[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}$ is the commutator from [[93-df-commutator]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}$ is the type-indexed quotient constructor of [[93-df-quotient-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbAlg}","display":false},{"tex":"[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\n\\leftrightarrow[\\nabla_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq\\theta\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf A/\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"[\\theta,\\theta]=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e2be868cf664b716","30b341bfbd8b5301","18ca772ab524a46f","510bd94349c4c6d9","c8ff2f79b6a4018b"]}